andomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn the early morning, the bus is as crowded as usual. Zhao Lei gets on the bus and finds her neighbor, Mr. Zhang, is wearing casual clothes that he usually does not wear. She greets him excitedly: \"Mr. Zhang, good morning! Usually, I do not see you go out at this time, do you take a day off today?\" Mr. Zhang nods his head without saying much. The bus drives to the next stop, and Zhao Lei still happily continues to say: \"That is a rare rest time, you must enjoy it.\" Mr. Zhang responds with a light \"hmm\", and turns his head to look out the window. Zhao Lei starts to eat the breakfast she just bought.\n\n[Question]\nDoes Zhao Lei know that Mr. Zhang is unemployed?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Knows\nB. Does not know","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007576974946599953,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52afcc2ddb05a7fe2f55e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452220326,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:57:00","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ab0e88461d0048f4b676871c78daa0a6"}